  "solution": "TXĐ: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ddfc0581cf299dc02a2d78f630c83a76243835dbc3a2bf89778a9937d927a2a0.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTừ đó ta xét tính đúng sai của các khẳng định:\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đúng vì<br>\n\t\t\tTa có: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semant